\c 2
\s1 A Warning to the Priests
\p \v 1 “\w And now|strong="H06258"\w* \w this|strong="H02063"\w* \w decree|strong="H04687"\w* \w is for you|strong="H00413"\w*, \w O priests|strong="H03548"\w*:
