\s1 Judah’s Unfaithfulness
\p \v 10 \w Do we not|strong="H03808"\w* \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w have one|strong="H00259"\w* \w Father|strong="H00001"\w*? \w Did not|strong="H03808"\w* \w one|strong="H00259"\w* \w God|strong="H00410"\w* \w create us|strong="H01254"\w*? \w Why then|strong="H04069"\w* \w do we break faith|strong="H00898"\w* \w with one|strong="H00376"\w* \w another|strong="H00251"\w* \w so as to profane|strong="H02490"\w* \w the covenant|strong="H01285"\w* \w of our fathers|strong="H00001"\w*?
